//! egui application: state, actions, and data operations.
//!
//! Drawing lives in [`shell`] (title bar, sidebar, status bar, command palette,
//! workspace tabs) and [`views`] (one module per page). Shared primitives live
//! in [`components`], colours and sizes in [`theme`], and icons in [`icons`].

